育背景Experience and Education：\r\n（1）两年以上相关工作经验\r\n（2）机械、模具相关专业，本科以上学历\r\n\r\n其他Others：\r\n（1）普通话标准，英语读写流利\r\n（2）工作认真务实，易于沟通，为人诚信。思维活跃、思路敏捷，良好的团队协作\r\n","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":"昆山协同研发中心","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"2年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-05T08:59:35","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"4227fcaf-d415-4ded-9e5b-f3f8e3a04d35","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351624948,"PostDateInt":1793684737000,"PostDate":"2026-11-03T13:45:37","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"产品经理-DAQ产业应用方向(J10982)","OrgId":985190,"Org":"ACN","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["陕西省·西安市·经济技术开发区/高新区"],"Salary":"13K-20K 元/月","Duty":"1. 产业应用 DAQ 解决方案规划与开发\n•\t深入了解目标产业及客户应用需求，将产业需求转化为 Domain DAQ System 的产品规格、功能定义及发展蓝图（Product Roadmap）。\n•\t规划整合 DAQ 硬件、IPC 运算平台及应用软件的系统解决方案，定义系统架构、软件功能需求，并推动产品开发及落地。\n•\t探索 AI / ML、智能数据分析及异常侦测等技术在 DAQ 产业应用上的发展机会。\n2. 策略客户经营与 Design-in 推动\n•\t发掘半导体及其他重点产业的策略客户，共同制定客户开发及产品导入策略。\n•\t直接与客户技术团队沟通，掌握应用场景、技术需求及痛点，提出具体的 DAQ System 解决方案并协调内部资源进行验证、落地等。\n3. 区域业务发展支持\n•\t协助公司产品业务经理拓展中国西区 DAQ 市场，发掘潜在产业应用及客户商机。\n•\t与业务团队合作，将产业应用需求转化为具体项目及业务机会。","Require":"1. 学历要求\n•\t硕士（含）以上学历，信息工程、软件工程、自动化、电子工程等相关理工科毕业。\n2. 工作经验\n•\t具备三年以上软件研发、软件产品管理或系统解决方案开发相关经验。\n•\t具备工业自动化、半导体设备、半导体测试、汽车电子测试或相关产业经验。\n•\t曾参与产品规划、技术项目管理或跨部门系统整合项目者尤佳。\n3. 专业技能\n•\t具备软件开发流程、系统架构及软硬件整合的基本知识。\n•\t熟悉 DAQ、数据撷取系统、工业计算机平台或测试量测系统者佳。\n•\t能够分析客户需求，并将需求转化为具体的软件功能规格及系统解决方案。\n•\t具备 AI / ML、数据分析或智能测试相关技术概念者佳。\n4. 个人特质与核心能力\n•\t具备独立思考、逻辑分析及问题解决能力，能主动发掘问题并提出具体解决方案。\n•\t具备良好的沟通协调能力，能有效串联客户、业务及软件研发团队。\n•\t具备市场敏感度与客户导向思维，能从产业需求出发进行产品规划。\n•\t具备主动积极及项目推动能力，能从需求定义、产品开发到客户导入全程负责。\n•\t具备良好的英文沟通能力，能配合跨区域团队合作。\n四、加分条件\n•\t曾参与半导体制造设备、ATE、IGBT 或功率半导体测试相关项目。\n•\t具备电动车 EOL Testing、NVH（噪音、振动与粗糙度）或工业设备状态监测相关经验。\n•\t曾参与 AI 项目，例如预测性维护（Predictive Maintenance）、异常侦测（Anomaly Detection）、智能检测或 AI 数据分析。\n•\t熟悉 IPC、DAQ Card / Module、传感器整合或自动化测试系统者佳。","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"硕士研究生","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-03T13:45:37",